{"id":"passive-present-past","lv":"b1","n":16,"cat":"passive","t":"Bị động: is made, was built","en":"is / are + V3 · was / were + V3 · by","sum":"Bị động: be + V3 — khi việc được làm quan trọng hơn người làm, hoặc không biết / không cần nói ai làm: Coffee is grown in the mountains. The beans are picked by hand. My bike was stolen. Thì nằm ở be: is / are (hiện tại), was / were (quá khứ). Người làm đứng sau by, chỉ khi đáng nhắc tới. Hỏi: Where is it made? When was it built? Tiếng Việt lúc “được”, lúc “bị”, lúc không có gì — tiếng Anh chỉ một cấu trúc. Happen, arrive… không có tân ngữ thì không có bị động (was happened ✗).","forms":[{"f":"is / are + V3","vi":"Coffee is grown here."},{"f":"was / were + V3","vi":"This bridge was built in 1990."},{"f":"… by + người làm","vi":"The farm was started by my grandfather."},{"f":"Where is it made? · When was it built?","vi":"câu hỏi"}],"pts":[{"id":"passive-present-past","name":"Passive: present & past simple","vi":"Bị động: is / was + V3 (+ by)"}],"cast":{"ana":{"name":{"en":"Ana","vi":"Ana"},"look":"woman","style":{"outfit":"jacket","top":"#8C3B4A","topShade":"#76303D","accent":"#A23B55","hair":"curly","hairColor":"#2B1D18","skin":"#8D5A3C","skinShade":"#784A30"},"x":560},"jay":{"name":{"en":"Jay","vi":"Jay"},"look":"man","style":{"outfit":"apron","top":"#2E2E2E","topShade":"#222222","accent":"#707070","hair":"short","hairColor":"#1F1B1A","skin":"#A86F4C","skinShade":"#93603F"},"x":1040}},"bg":"village","beats":[{"k":"e","sec":"hook","en":"Wow, so this is where coffee comes from!","vi":"Ồ, hóa ra cà phê được làm ra ở đây!","ipa":["waʊ","soʊ","ðɪs","ɪz","wɛɹ","ˈkɑfi","kʌmz","fɹʌm"],"who":"ana","ann":{"expression":"happy"},"b":1,"start":0.454,"end":2.694,"timing":[[0,0.454],[1,0.722],[2,0.917],[3,1.164],[4,1.308],[5,1.529],[6,1.959],[7,2.31]]},{"k":"e","sec":"hook","en":"Yes. Coffee is grown here in the mountains. The beans are picked by hand.","vi":"Đúng vậy. Cà phê được trồng ở vùng núi này. Hạt được hái bằng tay.","ipa":["j